  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "2. Cut the baguette into 1-inch slices and toast until crispy.",
    "3. In a pan, heat olive oil over medium heat. Add sliced onions and cook until caramelized.",
    "4. In a separate pan, grill the beef brochette until cooked to your liking.",
    "5. Brush the toasted bread with olive oil and top with caramelized onions.",
    "6. Serve the beef brochette with crispy onions and toasted bread.",
    "7. Season with salt to taste.",
    "8. Serve immediately and enjoy!"
  ],
